<title>USA: EIA Monthly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</title>
<headline>EIA Monthly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</headline>
<text>
<p>U.S. PROPANE STOCKS (IN MILLION BARRELS)</p>
<p>		 09/30/96   08/31/96   09/95   08/95   Change/Mo</p>
<p>East Coast	 5.3	 4.3	4.9	5.1	+ 1.0</p>
<p>Midwest	   23.5	23.0     23.0     23.1	+ 0.5</p>
<p>Gulf Coast	19.9	20.7     27.4     26.1	- 0.8</p>
<p>U.S. Total	50.4	49.6     57.2     55.9	+ 0.8</p>
<p>Source: Estimates by U.S. Department of Energy's Energy Information Administration. EIA will report propane stocks on a monthly basis from May to September. - Totals may not equal sum of regions due to rounding.</p>
</text>
